# Provider tuning for the claude backend. Parsed as data, never sourced.
# Each value must follow a "# measured: <number>, <CLI version>, <date>" line.
# Keys without a measurement are omitted so the shipped default applies.
# Model pins never go here; they live in assets/calamus.env.
#
# Fixed per-call overhead: 3,698 input tokens for a six-word prompt through
# claude -p --safe-mode --tools "" (Claude Code 2.1.283, 2026-09-27). No
# threshold is tuned from it yet; CALAMUS_MIN_TEXT keeps the shipped default.
